00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.880
This podcast series is about why we age

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.490
and why we may not have to.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.820
Things you can do today and going forward

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:28.310
to increase your wellness

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:31.560
and to potentially live a
much longer healthier life.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.300
We've talked about the biology of aging,

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.880
we've talked about things
that you can do at home,

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.800
preferably under the
supervision of your doctor,

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.750
and today, we're going
to talk about things

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:43.550
that you definitely will be talking to

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:45.830
and requiring a doctor's
supervision to do,

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:48.960
and even things that your
doctor is unable to do,

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:51.500
but potentially in the
future may be able to.

