00:17:43.795 --> 00:17:48.000
who have been okay giving
these peptides to patients.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.060
- And what we're looking for

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:51.300
when we give peptides to people,

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:53.790
specifically for the cause of anti-aging,

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:56.540
is a boost of regenerative signaling.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:57.373
- Right.

00:17:57.373 --> 00:17:58.890
So what you're looking for is the ability

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:02.136
to recover from damage,
increased wound healing,

00:18:02.136 --> 00:18:05.700
lower blood sugar levels,
increased mitochondrial activity.

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:09.800
Those are examples or signatures
