00:19:00.439 --> 00:19:03.020
and improves fatty liver, which are again,

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:05.180
signatures of potential longevity.

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:09.470
- And so your belief at this point is that

00:19:09.470 --> 00:19:13.500
there are likely peptides
that are valuable

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:17.490
when it comes to addressing
