00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:00.550
And then that sent shock waves.

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.368
This was March of 2020.

00:20:02.368 --> 00:20:05.590
And so since then, it's been impossible

00:20:05.590 --> 00:20:08.040
